WEBVTT

00:02:00.491 --> 00:02:04.287
The same pocket in which he kept
his fishing worms.

00:02:04.287 --> 00:02:05.872
(Laughter)

00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:09.584
That's true.

00:02:09.584 --> 00:02:10.877
(Laughter)

00:02:12.086 --> 00:02:17.049
I read once that every time
an old woman dies,

00:02:17.049 --> 00:02:19.385
a library disappears.

00:02:21.637 --> 00:02:23.764
And before her library disappeared,

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:26.934
I tuned into my grandmother's signals

00:02:26.976 --> 00:02:33.232
and gleaned her tenacity